==id $Id: bsdsocket_ifindex_lib.sfd,v 1.0 2026-10-21 $
==libname bsdsocket_ifindex
* DRAFT: four proposed common bsdsocket.library interface-index vectors.
* This file describes an extension of SocketBase, not a second library.
* The offsets are subject to independent cross-stack review and agreement.
* Entries before -0x372 are deliberately neither defined nor renumbered here.
* Call only after establishing that the loaded library supports this ABI.
* A revision or vector-table size alone cannot establish slot semantics.
==base _SocketBase
==bias 882
==public
==include <exec/types.h>
==include <net/if.h>
ULONG if_nametoindex(const char *ifname) (a0)
char *if_indextoname(ULONG ifindex, char *ifname) (d0,a0)
struct if_nameindex *if_nameindex() ()
VOID if_freenameindex(struct if_nameindex *ptr) (a0)
==end
